| `fw_patch_8800d80_u02.bin` | 30944 | `0cd045e94e225d7dfe2e14c0bd5045db76e68b2c7a41278885ca75c1908da4eb` | `8a96b6d133dfc768aadf1ac3b1e15bd2` | the ROM patch |
